                "text": "**The Line.** One railway, twelve stops, from Berry Town on the edge of the map to Fruit City at the end. A small purple-and-cream train, the 6:15, runs it every day. Each stop is a neighbourhood with its own music, its own rules and one dancer everybody talks about.",
