                "text": "**Canteen.** Long benches, a hatch with steaming trays, a menu board of \"Today's Experiments\" (soup, possibly). Mrs. Satsuma behind the hatch in a hairnet. A fridge with a sign \"DR. LEMON'S. DO NOT. EVER.\"",
