                "text": "**Watermelon's kitchen.** Big, round, warm: everything is round. Round pans, a round table, a round window. Shelves of cookbooks with titles like \"Feeding Five Hundred\" and \"Feeding One (Me)\". The second book has never been opened. A wall of thank-you notes from customers. A jar marked SECRET SAUCE.",
                "nodes": [],
