                "kind": "note",
                "text": "**Rumour 9 (Fig):** \"She asked which train goes furthest.\" Tape: the Summer Legend on a crate in a tunnel, a train rushing past, her shadow on the carriage wall. *True detail:* she took a job on the train.",
                "nodes": [],
