                    "cells": ["Coconut (round 2)","**Coconut** (neutral): Not passing.","**Raspberry** (bold): We passed you last week, shell-head.","**Pear** (neutral): {slow}Bro's still on four words. Respect, man.{/slow}","**Dr. Lemon** (neutral): Two words. He's saving them. Fascinating.","**Watermelon** (happy): You had four helpings! I saw! You're a big softie!"],
