        "title": "7.1 Intro",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "main",
            "label": "main",
            "nodes": [
              {"kind":"dir","text":"The stage clears. Two spotlights. Berry on the left, hood up. Blueberry on the right, crown pin on his jacket. Orange leans so far over his railing that a stagehand holds his belt."},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Orange","mood":"bold","text":"{big}THE FINAL SET!{/big} The hoodie against the champion! Double points!","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.0"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"smug","text":"Forty-one and oh. Tonight's forty-two. Then the record. Then the big tour.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.1"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"smug","text":"Then a statue, probably, outside the station, with a better chin than this one, and...","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.2"},
              {
                "kind": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "label": "Cut in",
                    "nodes": [
                      {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"smug","text":"...a little plaque that says","cut":true,"id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.3"},
                      {"kind":"dir","text":"His letters tumble out of the box and bounce off the stage. The crowd goes \"ooooh\"."},
                      {"kind":"line","speaker":"Berry","mood":"soft","text":"I heard your message.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.4"},
                    ],
                    "sets": ["cutBlueberry"],
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Let him finish",
                    "nodes": [
                      {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"smug","text":"...a little plaque that says \"undefeated\". Like hers.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.5"},
                      {"kind":"line","speaker":"Berry","mood":"soft","text":"I heard your message.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.6"},
                    ],
                  },
                ],
              },
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"shocked","text":"{pause=1.0} ...You what?","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.7"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Berry","mood":"soft","text":"July. The seat. I heard it. On a roof. Two days ago.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.8"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"neutral","text":"{slow}Four months late, hoodie.{/slow}","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.9"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Berry","mood":"neutral","text":"I'm slow at answering.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.10"},
              {"kind":"line","speaker":"Blueberry","mood":"neutral","text":"{pause} Doesn't matter. {pause} Last round. Just us. Like old times.","id":"finale.7-1-intro.main.11"},
            ],
          },
        ],
